{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "4498f76f-c525-8795-b066-b14e1b7b1118",
  "created_at": "2025-12-01T12:35:06-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Carlos Costa",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:32:39-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:32:43-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. I'm calling about a drainage problem at 297 Ocean Avenue, the Ocean Drive side. [pause] Sorry, I'm keeping my voice down, my supervisor's walking by. I'm on my lunch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:32:54-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time. What's going on there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:32:58-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's a snowbank sitting right on the catch basin at the end of the lane. Plowed it there, I guess. So now the water can't get in and it pools clear across the lane. And there's no storm. It's dry out. This is just from the melt and, I don't know, it just sits."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:33:17-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so the basin's buried under the plowed snow and the meltwater has nowhere to go."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:33:23-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. As I said before, and I did say it before, this keeps happening. [sighs] Nobody comes to clear it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:33:31-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry about that. Do you know if anyone has called it in previously?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:33:37-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't know who called. I'm asking you. When did they last come by there? Cleaning it out, checking it, anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:33:45-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me pull up the address. [pause] I'm looking at 297 Ocean Avenue. I'm not seeing a recent cleaning on the screen in front of me, but I can have the crew supervisor confirm the full history for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:33:59-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Fine. And there's another thing. The manhole cover right near it, it looks off. Like it's sitting maybe an inch high on one side. Or low, I can't tell. Cars go over it and it clunks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:34:12-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good to know. Is that in the lane too, close to the catch basin?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:34:18-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, maybe ten feet up from it. Toward the road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:34:22-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. I'll put both on one work order: snowbank on the catch basin with water pooling across the lane, and the manhole cover that's sitting off by about an inch. Can I get a callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:34:35-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0173."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:34:37-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0173. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:34:39-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Carlos Costa."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:34:41-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Mr. Costa. I'll mark it so they clear the basin first, since that's what's holding the water. Someone should call you back about when it was last serviced."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:34:51-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'd just like somebody to actually show up this time. [pause] Alright, I gotta go, he's coming back this way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:34:59-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Thanks for calling, and enjoy what's left of your lunch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:35:04-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. Thanks."
    }
  ],
